WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
MDA1 · Cooperative tray transfer

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Approach the pickup table

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Park and align both arms

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Close both grippers

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Lift the tray

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Move and turn the base

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Park and lower the tray

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.500
Open the grippers

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.000
Retract both arms

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Task complete
